---
import InteractiveHoverButton from '../components/21st/InteractiveHoverButton.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About · Pascal Rhee"
  description="Pascal Rhee's background in data science, applied AI, commercial operations, and product management."
  section="about"
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">A little about me</p>
    <h1 class="display">
      Technical depth.
      <br />
      <em>A wider lens.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I’m Pascal, a University of Michigan graduate working across data science,
      applied AI, and the practical side of building useful things.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="page-section two-col">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">01 / Background</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Working across
        <br />
        <em>the boundaries.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body-copy">
      <p>
        I work at the American Bureau of Shipping (ABS), where my experience
        spans the technical and business sides of building with AI.
      </p>
      <p>
        Rotations through applied AI, commercial operations, and product
        management gave me different views of the same challenge: understanding
        what people need, figuring out what technology can do, and connecting
        the two.
      </p>
      <p>
        My current focus is internal AI enablement. I’m interested in the space
        between a technical idea and something people can actually use:
        understanding the problem, weighing the tradeoffs, and explaining the
        solution clearly.
      </p>
      <p>
        I graduated from the University of Michigan in May 2025 with a B.S. in
        Data Science and a minor in Entrepreneurship.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section two-col">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">02 / Along the way</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Experience in
        <br />
        <em>perspective.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="history">
      <li>
        <small>2025 TO PRESENT</small>
        <h3>American Bureau of Shipping</h3>
        <p>
          Data Scientist. Experience across applied AI, commercial operations,
          product management, and internal AI enablement.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>2024</small>
        <h3>Nissan Motor Corporation</h3>
        <p>
          Data Scientist Intern, Big Data Team. Worked on a survey analysis
          pipeline using open source language models and cloud tooling.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>2023</small>
        <h3>American Bureau of Shipping</h3>
        <p>
          Data Science Intern, Data &amp; Analytics. Worked on a Power BI data
          lineage visualization to make relationships across data assets easier
          to explore.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>CLASS OF 2025</small>
        <h3>University of Michigan</h3>
        <p>
          B.S. in Data Science · Minor in Entrepreneurship
          <br />
          Ann Arbor, Michigan
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section two-col">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">03 / In the toolkit</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        From questions
        <br />
        <em>to prototypes.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="tool-groups">
        <div>
          <h3>Used in work</h3>
          <div class="pill-row">
            {[
              'Python',
              'Power BI',
              'AWS SageMaker',
              'Hugging Face',
              'LangChain',
            ].map((tool) => (
              <span>{tool}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Personal building</h3>
          <div class="pill-row">
            {[
              'Astro',
              'Cloudflare Workers',
              'GitHub',
              'VS Code',
              'Claude Code',
            ].map((tool) => (
              <span>{tool}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Currently learning</h3>
          <div class="pill-row">
            {['Snowflake', 'SQL', 'Databricks'].map((tool) => (
              <span>{tool}</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        The tools depend on the problem. I use AI tools to move faster, while
        staying able to explain and adapt what they produce.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section two-col" aria-labelledby="beyond-work">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">04 / Beyond work</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="beyond-work">
        A few other
        <br />
        <em>interests.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="interest-list">
      <article>
        <h3>Pickleball</h3>
        <p>I enjoy competitive pickleball.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Pokémon cards</h3>
        <p>I collect graded Pokémon cards.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Games &amp; simulations</h3>
        <p>
          I play Overwatch and Bloons TD Battles 2. I’m also interested in games
          that make complex systems tangible, and I’m exploring a few ideas of
          my own.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="contact-panel">
    <div>
      <h2>Let’s compare notes.</h2>
      <p>The best place to reach me is LinkedIn.</p>
    </div>
    <InteractiveHoverButton
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jprhee/"
      label="Say hello"
    />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
